<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-180.2-price-freeze-governance-state-of-calamity-controls-regulatory-reporting" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W5185" name="W5185. LGU State of Calamity Declaration Trigger &amp; Pricing Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: National government (NDRRMC) or LGU Council declaring a State of Calamity in store regions
Frequency: Event-driven per declaration
Volume: ~15–20 declarations monitored annually
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Participants: DTI Liaison, Legal Operations (VS-100), Store Managers
Source: workflow W5185 — LGU State of Calamity Declaration Trigger &amp; Pricing Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5185_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5185_Lane1" name="Regulatory Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5185_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5185_Start3" name="National government (NDRRMC) or LGU Council declaring a State of Calamity in store regions">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5185_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5185_Task4" name="Monitor official Gazette and NDRRMC releases for State of Calamity declarations.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monitor official Gazette and NDRRMC releases for State of Calamity declarations.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Accountable (A): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5185_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5185_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5185_Task5" name="Identify affected BuildRight store locations within the declared cities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify affected BuildRight store locations within the declared cities, municipalities, or provinces.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Accountable (A): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5185_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5185_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5185_Task6" name="Verify the official date and timing of the declaration (which triggers the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Verify the official date and timing of the declaration (which triggers the statutory 60-day price freeze under the Price Act, RA 7581).
Responsible (R): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Accountable (A): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5185_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5185_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5185_Task7" name="Issue formal price freeze notification to the Pricing Team, Store Managers, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Issue formal price freeze notification to the Pricing Team, Store Managers, and the CFO.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Accountable (A): Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5185_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5185_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5185_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5185_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-83 (ensure calamity pricing &amp; relief-channel compliance.) | - CTL-771: Declaration log maintained by Legal; affected store list signed off by Compliance Officer.
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer / Pricing Lead (VS-01.2)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5185_Assoc10" sourceRef="W5185_Annotation9" targetRef="W5185_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
