Volume: Reconciliation of affected store groups (~20–40 stores)
Owner: Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / Tax Accountant (VS-79)
Participants: Category Managers (VS-01), Controller, Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W5188 — Price Freeze Audit, Margin Impact Analysis &amp; Financial Provisioning</bpmn:documentation>
