      <bpmn:userTask id="W5188_Task4" name="Calculate margin dilution: compare actual purchase costs (spiking due to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Calculate margin dilution: compare actual purchase costs (spiking due to emergency shipping) against frozen selling prices.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / Tax Accountant (VS-79)
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / Tax Accountant (VS-79)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
