        <bpmn:outgoing>W5188_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5188_Task7" name="Set up financial provisions in the General Ledger (VS-17.1) for expected margin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Set up financial provisions in the General Ledger (VS-17.1) for expected margin drops.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / Tax Accountant (VS-79)
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / Tax Accountant (VS-79)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
