      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: State of Calamity declaration (W5185); DTI advisory on basic necessity limits
Frequency: Event-driven per calamity
Volume: ~15–20 configurations annually
Owner: POS Administrator / IT Developer (VS-27)
Participants: Zoning Officer (VS-76), POS Cashiers (VS-08), Store Manager
Source: workflow W5189 — Anti-Hoarding &amp; Quantity-Limit Rules POS Configuration</bpmn:documentation>
