      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LGU declaration of State of Calamity
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: 10–20 store permits affected annually
Owner: LGU Compliance Liaison (VS-76)
Participants: City/Municipal Treasurer, Business Permit Licensing Office (BPLO), Tax Manager (VS-79)
Source: workflow W5190 — State of Calamity LGU Regulatory Permit Clearance &amp; Fee Deferrals</bpmn:documentation>
