    <bpmn:process id="W_W5191" name="W5191. Emergency Import Tariffs/Customs Duty Deferral Application" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: National disaster causing massive supply shortfalls; imports of reconstruction materials (lumber, roofing) prioritized
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~3–5 applications annually
Owner: Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Participants: Bureau of Customs (BOC), DOF (Dept of Finance), Import team (VS-02.2)
Source: workflow W5191 — Emergency Import Tariffs/Customs Duty Deferral Application</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5191_LaneSet2">
