      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5191_Start3" name="National disaster causing massive supply shortfalls; imports of reconstruction materials…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5191_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5191_Task4" name="Identify imported cargo (e.g. lumber, steel coil) in transit for disaster…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify imported cargo (e.g. lumber, steel coil) in transit for disaster relief.
Responsible (R): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Accountable (A): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5191_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5191_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5191_Task5" name="File application for tariff exemption or duty deferral under DOF/BOC emergency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: File application for tariff exemption or duty deferral under DOF/BOC emergency disaster relief rules (e.g. RA 10863 / CMTA provisions).
Responsible (R): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Accountable (A): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5191_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5191_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5191_Task6" name="Provide documentation: import manifests, certificates of donation/relief…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Provide documentation: import manifests, certificates of donation/relief supply, LGU letters, and cargo distribution plans.
Responsible (R): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Accountable (A): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5191_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5191_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5191_Task7" name="Secure BOC Customs Release Order for duty-deferred release; transport cargo…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Secure BOC Customs Release Order for duty-deferred release; transport cargo directly from port to DC/affected stores.
Responsible (R): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Accountable (A): Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5191_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
