        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-771 (ensure controlled execution — Price Freeze Governance, State of Calamity Controls &amp; Regulatory Reporting (PA-180.2).) | - CTL-771: BOC Customs Release Order signed by authorized collector; compliance reports filed post-delivery showing material distribution.
Owner: Customs Compliance Manager / Tariff Specialist (VS-87)</bpmn:text>
