        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-771 (ensure controlled execution — Price Freeze Governance, State of Calamity Controls &amp; Regulatory Reporting (PA-180.2).) | - CTL-771: Loss write-off approved by CFO; BIR filing certificate signed by tax agent.
Owner: Tax Manager (VS-79)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
